  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S7_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: Well, I'm sure it will get better the more time we spend together at the
      company. I just hope we can have a more comfortable and light atmosphere at
      work soon.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try to get these thoughts out of my head, but there is a weird, indescribable
      feeling that lingers in my chest.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Soon enough, after some hours have passed, the bunker door opens, and we
      learn that the earthquake is officially over and it's safe for us to return
      to the surface again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
